OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FAriana Grande has thanked fans for
OL,8,Ftheir "overwhelming" support as she
OL,9,Fbegan her O2 residency following the
OL,10,Fnews she is to step back from public
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,FThe concert on Saturday night, which
OL,14,Fis the first of 10 nights at the north
OL,15,FGreenwich venue, began with a curtain
OL,16,Ffalling down to reveal the 33-year-old
OL,17,Fin a black corset with her band in
OL,18,Fsimilar attire.
OL,26,@pD@GOUpD@TO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
