FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786873687
OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FTowards the end of the show, Grande
OL,8,Ftold the crowd they were "by far the
OL,9,Floudest" of the tour so far, before
OL,10,Fadding that their support throughout
OL,11,Fthe run had been "overwhelming".
OL,13,FShe said over ear-splitting screams
OL,14,Ffrom the crowd: "I'm so grateful to be
OL,15,Fdoing this with you all... these 10
OL,16,Fdates are the last stop on this tour."
OL,18,FGrande later added: "You've shown me
OL,19,Fso much love so I want to say thank
OL,20,Fyou."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@HO]sD@ROUsD@_O]vD@QOUxD@fO]zD@
OL,26,AUOU|D@EO]
