OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786873687
OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FShe also said she was "so, so lucky"
OL,8,Fand added that she was "grateful" for
OL,9,Fher fans.
OL,11,FThe set drew heavily on Grande's 2024
OL,12,Falbum Eternal Sunshine with some
OL,13,Ftracks from her latest album Petal, as
OL,14,Fwell as her best known hits such as
OL,15,FInto You, Thank U, Next and 7 Rings,
OL,16,Falong with a cover of Lady Gaga's Rain
OL,17,FOn Me.
OL,26,@oD@WOUoD@dO]pD@XOUpD@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/8
