PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786873687
OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FShortly after arriving on stage she
OL,8,Ftold the crowd: "London, it's so good
OL,9,Fto see us, isn't it? Welcome to the
OL,10,FEternal Sunshine tour."
OL,12,FHer elaborate staging saw her perform
OL,13,Fin a rundown house and the lighting
OL,14,Frig being transformed into a police
OL,15,Fhelicopter, while Grande waved and
OL,16,Fblew kisses to fans throughout.
OL,26,@pD@QOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/8
