CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786873687
OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FVideos breaking up each act of the
OL,8,Fperformance gave the concert a
OL,9,Fcinematic feel, with one clip
OL,10,Ffeaturing scenes from The Wizard Of Oz
OL,11,Fin reference to her role in the Wicked
OL,12,Ffilms.
OL,14,FThe show comes after Grande announced
OL,15,Flast month that she would take a step
OL,16,Fback from the spotlight after she
OL,17,Fcompletes the residency, which will
OL,18,Fbring an end to her Eternal Sunshine
OL,19,Ftour.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
