OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786873687
OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FIt follows Grande's music video for
OL,8,FPetal, the title single from her newly
OL,9,Freleased eighth studio album, which
OL,10,Fsparked speculation about her health.
OL,12,FThe singer also appeared to confirm
OL,13,Fher relationship with dancer and
OL,14,Fphotographer Ricky Alvarez on
OL,15,FInstagram earlier this week.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/8
