OL,3,CGrande thanks fans for support at O2
OL,4,Cgig after announcing break from public
OL,5,Clife
OL,7,FPetal became Grande's sixth
OL,8,Fconsecutive number one album last week
OL,9,Ffollowing Dangerous Woman (2016),
OL,10,FSweetener (2018), Thank U, Next
OL,11,F(2019), Positions (2020) and Eternal
OL,12,FSunshine.
